title: "The Trerrote Connection"
abstract: "A PRG32 tribute game to Tony Tammaro and an open teaching artifact for RV32IMC: a pseudo-3D road and row compositor on an 8-bit indexed framebuffer, in a 64 KiB cartridge, with an original eight-voice SID-like stereo soundtrack."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Montella
    given-names: Raffaele
    affiliation: "University of Naples Parthenope"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/riscv-prg32/TheTrerroteConnection"
keywords: [RISC-V, PRG32, education, game, indexed colour, pseudo-3D, SID]
